\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 They appear to be taking the latter approach by somehow claiming that the last 10 years of denial and delay don\u8217 t count and somehow claiming that the government that\u8217 s been in for four weeks is somehow, you know \u8211  by talking about renewables \u8211  is somehow spooking the coal fire generators to not working.}
{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24\par}\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033
